  "description": "On the Hunt lasts 30 seconds: +20% movement speed, attack speed, mining speed and melee damage, with orange creature outlines within 64 blocks. Undetectable creatures stay hidden. Effective Champion cooldown: 60 seconds (120-second base).\n\nSneak and hold Primary for 5 seconds to mark a visible creature within 64 blocks. Up to 3 targets can be marked for 90 seconds each, with orange outlines and +25% damage from you. Marks belong to their caster. Effective mark cooldown: 30 seconds (60-second base). Marking does not slow you.",
